device 1 close
pre-erase off
label case asis
set postscript ppi 800
ylabel offset units absolute
ylabel offset 12
char size 1
label size 4.5
tic mark label size 4.5
char fill on
char circle 
lines blank
skip 25
read pontius.dat y x
quadratic fit y X
device 2 postscript
multiplot 2 2
multiplot coordinates 0 0 100 100
frame coordinates 15 29 90 99
y1label offset 13.5
y1label Residuals
x1label Run Order
x3label Run Order Plot
plot res 
frame coordinates 24 29 99 99
y1label Residuals
x1label Residuals Lag 1
x3label Lag Plot
major xtic mark number 5
lag plot res 
major xtic mark number 
frame coordinates 15 20 90 90
y1label Frequency
x1label Residual Values
x3label Histogram
histogram res 
frame coordinates 24 20 99 90
y1label Residuals
x1label Standard Normal Distribution Quantiles
x3label Normal Probability Plot
normal probability plot res 
multiplot off
device 2 close
system mv dppl1f.dat gra2d.ps
quit
